    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents one multiplexed V2 connection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single <ref refid="classthemis_1_1wire_1_1_v2_session" kindref="compound">V2Session</ref> manages many logical streams (<ref refid="structthemis_1_1wire_1_1_v2_stream" kindref="compound">V2Stream</ref>) over a single TCP socket. It is created by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1wire_1_1_v2_server" kindref="compound">V2Server</ref> when a new client connects and destroyed when the connection is torn down. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
